<div n="2"><head>10.<lb/>
<hi rendition="#g">William Lovell</hi> an <hi rendition="#g">Emilie Burton</hi>.</head><lb/>
<p><hi rendition="#in">H</hi>ier &#x017F;itz' ich nun, theure&#x017F;te Emilie, in mei-<lb/>
