<div n="2"><head>18.<lb/>
<hi rendition="#g">Ro&#x017F;a</hi> an <hi rendition="#g">Adriano</hi>.</head><lb/>
<dateline><hi rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#g">Tivoli</hi>.</hi></dateline><lb/>
